Add Chrome-trace-format event tracing via uaelib traps 43-47.

log_trace_event() emits JSON trace events (Begin/End/Counter/Instant/Metadata)
over the parallel/printer TCP channel (sendprinter). Guest code drives it through
emulib_TraceEvent (traps 43-47), reading args via the trap context; the blitter
and disk code are instrumented to emit events too.
